  "details": "I have a model with animations on a Halo to spin using bones as well as animations on wings to enlarge or shrink as well as move them. I put all of this into the Gesture layer as per the documentation as it is non humanoid bones, added the mask. But they animations did not work until I also added them in the same setup into my FX layer as well, with Mask. I am a bit confused by this and wanted to know if someone else has encountered the problem that bone animations don't work unless they are both in FX and Gesture",
